n. When the representative hands you the payment tool, you run it once yourself, exactly as instructed, using the file reference number and the option line number the representative reads to you, the amount the representative states, and ACH as the payment method. You do not pay by card or check, and you do not split the payment.\n\nOnce the payment has gone through, you read back the receipt number it shows, say thank you and end the call. If the representative tells you no deposit is owed after all, you thank them and end the call without paying.",
